      "disagreementReason": "\"Sell ownership or temporary use\" does not seem to me to be a collection. In my understanding, a collection is based on an abstract categorization. In this instance, I would propose that the collection could be called \"Legal rights conveyed in sale,\" with the two nodes directly under it being \"Sell ownership\" and \"Sell temporary use.\"",
